! Chapter 12 example: basis-set dependence of Mulliken charges (Hirshfeld/CM5 for comparison)
! Needs pyridine_opt.chk from pyridine_pop_nbo.gjf; same geometry, five basis sets
%oldchk=pyridine_opt.chk
%chk=pyridine_sto3g.chk
%mem=8GB
%nprocshared=8
#p B3LYP/STO-3G Pop=Hirshfeld Geom=Check

Pyridine Mulliken vs Hirshfeld/CM5 charges, B3LYP/STO-3G

0 1

--Link1--
%oldchk=pyridine_opt.chk
%chk=pyridine_631gd.chk
%mem=8GB
%nprocshared=8
#p B3LYP/6-31G(d) Pop=Hirshfeld Geom=Check

Pyridine Mulliken vs Hirshfeld/CM5 charges, B3LYP/6-31G(d)

0 1

